{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Futureal is a Turn-Based RPG game set in a Near-Future Sci-Fi world. Battle your way through the world against the Superintelligent Robots. As you face enemies and level up in the world of Futureal build up your crew and buy new items to make your character stronger. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you Challenge rogue robots in the futuristic world of Futureal with strategic turn based strategy combat you will level up your characters and build up your stats to face the many boss battles throughout the city.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Visit the shop to buy new items for your character as you level up in Futureal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are many quests to be completed as you make your way through the city challenging the rogue robots.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Futureal is set in a Near-Future Sci-Fi City where superintelligent robots have gone rogue and the humans and cyborgs must defeat them to survive.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3729950?t=1749294343","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3729950?t=1749294343","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3729950/96d7f8ca7f59ce15954732f20dfc51eb07b9d93b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749294343","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3729950/96d7f8ca7f59ce15954732f20dfc51eb07b9d93b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749294343","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Futureal is a Turn-Based RPG game set in a Near-Future Sci-Fi world. Battle your way through the world against the Superintelligent Robots. As you face enemies and level up in the world of Futureal build up your crew and buy new items to make your character stronger. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you Challenge rogue robots in the futuristic world of Futureal with strategic turn based strategy combat you will level up your characters and build up your stats to face the many boss battles throughout the city.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Visit the shop to buy new items for your character as you level up in Futureal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are many quests to be completed as you make your way through the city challenging the rogue robots.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Futureal is set in a Near-Future Sci-Fi City where superintelligent robots have gone rogue and the humans and cyborgs must defeat them to survive.</p>","developers":["InScienceGames","Matt Alister Lawrence"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3729950/73a4d97f708e4eb69945a410cb0600d7b1a27099/header.jpg?t=1749294343","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3729950/1135399029/09be8b6c401871638800cef09a5a454318626557/1750395858/dash_av1.mpd?t=1748100235","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3729950/1135399029/09be8b6c401871638800cef09a5a454318626557/1750395858/dash_h264.mpd?t=1748100235","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3729950/1135399029/09be8b6c401871638800cef09a5a454318626557/1750395858/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1748100235","id":257142295,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_